# INVWINLA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: Items > Loans and
# holds, the views of every item's loans and holds in the frame.  The
# open rows are none.  INS asks for the item of a new loan, its ID or
# text to find it: 5150, no item's ID, lists the available items holding
# it, IBM's 5150, as text, and ESC keeps the dialog; Tandon lists those
# holding it to choose from, and ENTER on item 2 goes on with OK, which
# shows a new loan, quantity 1, refused while its borrower, then its due
# date, is missing, the message under the fields and the focus on the
# field, and on a quantity above what is on hand, the server's reason and
# the focus on the quantity; mended, it is added, due in 2020, and the
# list fetched again marks it late with '!'; DEL does nothing.  A second
# loan, of item 1, due in 2099, comes after it; IBM, its one unit lent,
# is then in no pick list of the items that can be lent.  CTRL+PGDN goes
# on through the open loans, reservations and uses to the overdue rows,
# the first loan alone, then every row and again the open ones.  Return
# or release on the second asks for the return date: one before the loan
# went out is refused by the server, its reason in the dialog, which
# stays; one that is not a date is refused in the dialog too; a real one
# returns it, and the list fetched again has the first loan alone.  ESC
# goes back to the item list; the end by Exit.  Every date is typed, so
# that no snapshot holds the day of the run.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINLA.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I O
S EMPTY
K INS
S ASK
T 5150
K ENTER
S DIGITS
K ESC
T Tandon
K ENTER
S PICK
K ENTER
S NEW
K ENTER
S NOBORROW
T Ann Smith
K ENTER
S NODUE
T 2020-01-15
K STAB
T 2020-01-01
# back from the date out past the contact and the borrower
K STAB STAB STAB
T 3
K ENTER
S NOSTOCK
T 2
K ENTER
S LENT
K DEL INS
T 1
K ENTER TAB
T Bob Jones
K TAB TAB
T 2026-10-01
K TAB
T 2099-12-31
K ENTER
S TWO
# IBM's one unit is lent now: the items that can be lent hold none
K INS
T IBM
K ENTER
S NOFREE
K ESC ESC
K CPGDN CPGDN CPGDN CPGDN
S OVERDUE
K CPGDN
S ALL
K CPGDN DOWN ALT-C R
S ASKRET
T 2020-01-01
K ENTER
S BEFORE
# the date, selected, typed over
K SHIFT-HOME
T 2026-13-45
K ENTER
S BADDATE
T 2026-10-02
K ENTER
S RETURNED
K ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F X
